      <activity id="e9e327bc-2b09-597f-a543-f3d07e6e3d92" activityNameId="91e13d8a-88ca-5bd1-a3eb-6a9a9a2e0590" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper mill, non-integrated</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper mill, non-integrated
The dataset represents a non-integrated paper mill with a annual production of 368 kt and a total life time of 50 years.;
UUID: d1374aef-296d-3c4f-ae87-34fa433f19c2
This module includes the land-use, buildings (hall and multi-story) and streets within the mill area, machineries for pulp preparation and for paper and energy production as well as the dismanteling/disposal of the whole infrastructure (without the paper machine)
Location: Average land-use from European paper mills, valable for whole Europe
Technology: Typical European paper mill
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and estimations from similar processes 
Extrapolations: All information is estimated, based on dataset for an integrated paper mill.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d1374aef-296d-3c4f-ae87-34fa433f19c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
